       "src": "/images/wp/2021/10/Gerardo-Headshot.png",
       "title": "Gerardo Barrera",
       "description": "Finance Director-Massachusetts"
      },
      {
       "type": "text-editor",
       "id": "029ea6a",
       "style": {
        "": {
         "font-family": "var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif",
         "color": "#1E3A43",
         "text-align": "center"
        },
        "> .elementor-widget-container": {
         "padding": "1px 1px 1px 1px"
        }
       },
       "html": "<p>Gerardo began his journey in the travel industry 21 plus years ago when he joined as a Finance Director for StudentCity.com.  He gradually became the Chief Financial Officer of the parent company, TUI Education North America whose portfolio includes Brightspark, Educatours, Educational Tours, Jumpstreet, New Horizons, and Travel Adventures.  He is also the Co-Founder of Go Blue Tours, Juniper Tours, and Landmark Educational Tours.  <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-f3735e1 ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">Gerardo lives in Boston with his wife and two sons and loves to travel and ski in his spare time.   </span></p>"
      }
     ],
     "width": 100
